³1revision³181³1text_default³1ip³268.164.224.62³2ts³21118058193³2version³21³2name³2text_default³2data³2summary³3added login link³3text³3= <nowiki>AnCap</nowiki> Wiki =
[http://billstclair.com/wiki/ billstclair.com/wiki]

This is a UseMod wiki, dedicated to the creation, in our lifetimes, of anarcho-capitalist societies around the world. There are NonRules for this virtual place. [[Contributors]] please enter and sign in.

Due to a large volume of spam, it has been necessary to require an admin-password to edit this wiki. It's the first name, all lower-case, of the woman who wrote "America is at that awkward stage." To get the password and instructions for how to use it, contact BillStClair or [[Junker]].

See TextFormattingRules to learn how to make changes. [[UpdatingTips]] contains a few nuggets of wisdom that you might miss in the large documents.

Use the SandBox to play. Remember, a linked question mark is an invitation to share your knowledge.

----

== Starting Points ==

[[Anarcho-Capitalism]]: a short description of <nowiki>AnCap's</nowiki> salient features with links to places to learn more.

[[AnCap Sites]]: a list, with descriptions, of web sites of interest to anarcho-capitalists.

HowItWorks: how roads, schools, security, etc. work without a coercive state.

[[Implementation Stategies]]: how to get there from here.

[[Computers]]: notes on using and programming a powerful tool.

[[Self-Defense]]: mindset, tools, and techniques.

MarketPlace: advertise products & services, for sale, wanted, personals.

----

== Projects ==

AnCapWikiIconProject: see the funny looking image in the top right-hand corner of every page? This is the current selection ([[Ama-gi]]) from the list on this project page. If you have a better idea, post it there. Vote for your favorite.

StylesheetProject: The pages are boring. Needs some color.

[[Eco-Building]]: Innovating and building ecologic neighborhoods for sale.

FreeHunter is a mirror of http://lrt.mix6.com/w/Free_Hunter. It is for collecting legal information to help [http://www.libertyroundtable.org/projects/freehunter/ Jeff "Hunter" Jordan] extricate himself from the claws of the Ohio legal system. Please don't edit this mirror. Edit the lrt.mix6.com version, and then copy your changes here.

The [WikiNode wiki-node] links to out neighborhood.

